<html>
    <head>
        <title>Welcome to Terminus Drive</title>
    </head>
    <body style='font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;'>
        <div style='max-width: 600px; margin: auto; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 20px;'>
            {{> header}}
            <section>
                <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
                <p>Thank you for signing up with <strong>Terminus Drive</strong>. We're excited to have you on board and can't wait for you to start exploring the best vendors and services in your area.</p>
                <div style="text-align: center; margin: 25px 0;">
                    <a href='{{websiteUrl}}' style='display: inline-block; background-color: #f59e0b; color: white; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;'>
                        Start Exploring
                    </a>
                </div>
                <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, our support team is just an email away.</p>
            </section>
            {{> footer}}
        </div>
    </body>
</html>